[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; Floating dust motes. Ported from Unity's Dust_Particle: 5s life, 30/s,
; tiny sprites, almost no movement, gentle noise wander, white -> warm tan
; -> fade. The Red variant is byte-identical in Unity (same texture, tint
; and gradient), so both guids map to this one prefab.

